.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt ARNO-CLAUDE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm arno-claude
.Nd make what Claude Code learned of each project arno's
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Claude Code keeps what it learns of a project in a memory directory,
.Pa ~/.claude/projects/ Ns Ar name Ns Pa /memory ,
one file a fact, and a repository may hold rules for parts of it in
.Pa .claude/rules .
.Xr arno 1
reads neither.
.Nm
writes them into arno's own directory for each project,
.Pa ~/.local/share/arno/projects/ Ns Ar root ,
whose
.Pa AGENTS.md
arno reads as the project's last context file, and where the model may
read without asking.
.Pp
For each memory directory,
.Nm
takes the repository the sessions beside it ran in, as the first of them
that records its working directory says, and writes a file for every
worktree of that repository, so that a new worktree gets the
repository's memory on the next run.
Worktrees under
.Pa ~/.cache
and
.Pa /tmp ,
such as arno's own copies of a project, are left out; so is a bare
repository.
Each memory entry becomes a file of
.Pa memory/ ,
its description then its text, and
.Pa AGENTS.md
names each with its description, for the model to read the ones that
bear on its work, as Claude Code reads its own; then it has a line for
each rule in the worktree's
.Pa .claude/rules :
the paths it is for, from its
.Ql paths:
line, and where to read it.
Claude Code's agents, those of
.Pa ~/.claude/agents
then the project's
.Pa .claude/agents ,
become arno's roles in
.Pa roles/ ,
each its description then its text, the front matter's tools and model
left out.
.Pp
What it writes is
.Nm Ns 's
alone: written whole on every run, to a temporary put in its place, so
change the memory, the rules or the agents, not the copies.
Nothing is written into a repository, and arno knows nothing of Claude
Code's files.
.Pp
.Pa arno-claude.timer ,
a systemd user timer, runs it every hour; it can be run by hand at any
time.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.claude/projects/*/memory/*.md
Claude Code's memory entries, each with front matter giving its name and
description;
.Pa MEMORY.md ,
the index, is left out.
.It Pa ~/.local/share/arno/projects/ Ns Ar root Ns Pa /AGENTS.md , memory/ , roles/
What it writes, under
.Ev XDG_DATA_HOME
if that is set.
.It Pa ~/.config/systemd/user/arno-claude.service , arno-claude.timer
The hourly run, installed by arno's
.Ic make install
and turned on once with
.Ic systemctl --user enable --now arno-claude.timer .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0, or 2 if concha stopped on an error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr arno 1 ,
.Xr concha 1
